14. PHASE EIGHT — THE EARTH INTELLIGENCE CORE (EIC)
=====================================================================

Build or refine a central Earth Intelligence Core that coordinates the product's modules and scientific evidence.

The EIC is not merely a chatbot window. It is the orchestration and evidence layer connecting:
- Selected geographic location.
- User question and intent.
- Available datasets.
- Module capabilities.
- Scientific calculations.
- Spatial analysis.
- Temporal analysis.
- Knowledge graph.
- Persistent memory.
- Report generation.
